<title>RUSSIA: Russia pays $333.63 mln in MinFin coupons.</title>
<headline>Russia pays $333.63 mln in MinFin coupons.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Finance Ministry has paid $333.63 million in annual interest on three percent MinFin bonds, agent Vneshekonombank said on Wednesday in a statement.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
